# Supabase CLI local cache/link state — supabase/.temp/pooler-url is a Postgres connection string
# with embedded credentials (found untracked and unprotected during the Program vertical-slice
# task; never commit it). supabase/.branches/ is the CLI's equivalent for database branching.
# Migrations themselves (supabase/migrations/) are NOT covered by this and must stay tracked.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
